# cyto genome exported from cell 4 — load it via Load Genome (rename to cyto-brush.gene).
Break bb : Biomass < 4000 : Convert bb @15
Light : bb < 10000 : FormBond b b
Break bb : ab < a & ab < 1000 : FormBond a c @10
Break ac : a < ac & a < 1000 : FormBond a b @10
Break ab : ac < ab & ac < 1000 : Contract @6
